    font-size: 12px;\n      color: #5f5d59;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <p class=\"body-copy\">还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变。这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形，由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的篱笆在未安装好之前也不会变形。</p>\n    <p class=\"body-copy\">三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用，图 11.1-8 表示其中一些例子，你能再举一些例子吗？</p>\n\n    <section class=\"examples\">\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder bridge\">[图片：钢架桥]</div>\n        <figcaption>钢架桥</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder crane\">\n          [图片：起重机]\n          <span class=\"crane-lines\"></span>\n          <span class=\"crane-hook\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <figcaption>起重机</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"figure-number\">图 11.1-8</div>\n\n    <p class=\"body-copy second-copy\">四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用，图 11.1-9 表示其中一些例子。</p>\n\n    <section class=\"applications\">\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder rack\">[图片：活动挂架]</div>\n        <figcaption>活动挂架</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <figure>\n        <div class=\"placeholder gate\">[图片：伸缩门]</div>\n        <figcaption>伸缩门</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"figure-number\">图 11.1-9</div>\n\n    <section class=\"practice\">\n      <div class=\"practice-title\">练习</div>\n      <p class=\"question\">下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</p>\n\n      <div class=\"shape-grid\">\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形1\">\n            <polygon points=\"8,37 31,5 57,37\"></polygon>\n            <polygon points=\"31,5 72,5 57,37\"></polygon>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（1）</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形2\">\n            <rect x=\"9\" y=\"5\" width=\"61\" height=\"33\"></rect>\n            <line x1=\"39.5\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"39.5\" y2=\"38\"></line>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（2）</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形3\">\n            <rect x=\"18\" y=\"13\" width=\"42\" height=\"27\"></rect>\n            <polyline points=\"18,13 39,1 60,13\"></polyline>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（3）</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形4\">\n            <polygon points=\"7,5 66,1 58,41 19,40\"></polygon>\n            <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"41\"></line>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（4）</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形5\">\n            <polygon points=\"17,4 53,5 70,21 65,41 28,41 7,20\"></polygon>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（5）</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"shape-item\">\n          <svg class=\"shape\" viewBox=\"0 0 78 44\" aria-label=\"图形6\">\n            <polygon points=\"20,3 47,3 69,21 61,42 28,42 7,21\"></polygon>\n            <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"61\" y2=\"42\"></line>\n            <line x1=\"47\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"42\"></line>\n            <line x1=\"7\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"69\" y2=\"21\"></line>\n          </svg>\n          <span class=\"item-label\">（6）</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <span>第十一章　三角形</span>\n      <span class=\"page-number\">7</span>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
